        <p><span color="rgba(212,233,44,1)">$</span> cat vibe.txt</p>
        <p>"There's a new kind of coding</p>
        <p>I call <span color="rgba(212,233,44,1)">'vibe coding'</span>, where you</p>
        <p>fully give in to the vibes,</p>
        <p>embrace exponentials, and</p>
        <p><span color="rgba(212,233,44,1)">forget that the code even exists.</span>"</p>
        <p> </p>
        <p><span color="rgba(138,143,148,1)">— I barely even touch the</span></p>
        <p><span color="rgba(138,143,148,1)">  keyboard. Accept All, I don't</span></p>
        <p><span color="rgba(138,143,148,1)">  read the diffs anymore.</span></p>
